      "writtenOn": "2023-11-01T00:42:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we do not plan to register other instances of IAuthGraphKeyExchange in the compatibility matrix. For example, in this diagram https://sequencediagram.googleplex.com/view/5967481282756608 - which depicts how IAuthGraphKeyExchange is used in its first immediate use case, the IAuthGraphKeyExchange instance is retrieved from the other interface object which implements it - ISecreKeeper in this case.\n\nHowever, I will let David @drysdale@google.com confirm the answer to the above question.",
